*Key Formulae:*
- Indented contour on real line: $integral_(-oo)^oo f(x) d x = 2 I + i pi integral_0^oo 1/(x^2 + a^2) d x$
- Standard integral: $integral_0^oo d x / (x^2 + a^2) = pi / (2 a)$
- Residue: $"Res"_(i a) = (ln a + i pi / 2) / (2 i a)$
